on the set of "Spider-Man,"

00:03:45.892 --> 00:03:48.227
yeah, the new "Spider-Man,"
movie, and --

00:03:48.227 --> 00:03:49.528
And I was like, "Wow, that --"

00:03:49.528 --> 00:03:53.365
-I'm not sure about that.

00:03:53.365 --> 00:03:54.834
-We are.

00:03:54.834 --> 00:03:56.469
We're pretty sure.

00:03:56.469 --> 00:04:00.505
We're pretty sure about it,
so we know what's up.

00:04:00.505 --> 00:04:02.442
Do you know what's up?

00:04:02.442 --> 00:04:03.576
Are --

00:04:03.576 --> 00:04:06.145
[ Laughter ]

00:04:06.145 --> 00:04:08.347
What I'm telling you is,
you're going to be --

00:04:08.347 --> 00:04:10.382
You're in the new
"Spider-Man: No Way Home."

00:04:10.382 --> 00:04:11.483
Congratulations.
-Wait, what?

00:04:11.483 --> 00:04:13.519
-Yes! Congratulations.

00:04:13.519 --> 00:04:14.820
You're going to be in it. Yeah.

00:04:14.820 --> 00:04:17.123
That's exciting, right?
-I had no idea.

00:04:17.123 --> 00:04:19.124
Like, if --

00:04:19.124 --> 00:04:21.727
