00:04:28.167 --> 00:04:31.203
-No, yeah, it's not possible
to see a photo that you're in.

00:04:31.203 --> 00:04:32.504
-That's correct.
-No, I-I --

00:04:32.504 --> 00:04:33.739
No, I --

00:04:33.739 --> 00:04:36.576
