00:04:53.759 --> 00:04:56.028
-Oh, how convenient,
Detective Fallon.

00:04:56.028 --> 00:04:58.464
[ Laughter ]

00:04:58.464 --> 00:05:01.067
-I'm just saying. Yeah --
Yeah, it's been erased.

00:05:01.067 --> 00:05:02.968
But it was around,

00:05:02.968 --> 00:05:06.072
and we all saw it, and --

00:05:06.072 --> 00:05:08.174
-I heard about it.

00:05:08.174 --> 00:05:09.875
And I did see it.

00:05:09.875 --> 00:05:11.343
And it's a photoshop.

00:05:11.343 --> 00:05:13.946
-Oh.
-No!

00:05:13.946 --> 00:05:15.315
-We say no.

00:05:15.315 --> 00:05:17.216
-I'm trying to manage
expectations.

00:05:17.216 --> 00:05:19.418
You say no. Oh, you say no.

00:05:19.418 --> 00:05:20.553
[ Laughter ]

00:05:20.553 --> 00:05:21.854
-We're saying no.

00:05:21.854 --> 00:05:24.290
[ Laughter ]

00:05:24.290 --> 00:05:27.893
We're saying they should
reshoot the film.

00:05:27.893 --> 00:05:30.229
They should reshoot --
They got to reshoot the film.

00:05:30.229 --> 00:05:32.164
-Listen, if they want
to give me a call

00:05:32.164 --> 00:05:34.833
