and Spider-Man,

00:05:53.018 --> 00:05:54.854
so I'm just super stoked.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:05:54.854 --> 00:05:56.755
-Yeah, he's good. He's good.

00:05:56.755 --> 00:05:59.191
-And -- And I -- And I get
to just, like, be a fan again,

00:05:59.191 --> 00:06:01.393
which is my preferred position,

00:06:01.393 --> 00:06:04.163
